2026-06-19T01:01:34.7463763Z This launches a Tornado based HTML Server that serves up an HTML5/Javascript
2026-06-19T01:01:34.7464360Z JupyterLab client.
2026-06-19T01:01:34.7464544Z 
2026-06-19T01:01:34.7464716Z JupyterLab has three different modes of running:
2026-06-19T01:01:34.7465046Z 
2026-06-19T01:01:34.7465375Z * Core mode (`--core-mode`): in this mode JupyterLab will run using the JavaScript
2026-06-19T01:01:34.7466148Z   assets contained in the installed `jupyterlab` Python package. In core mode, no
2026-06-19T01:01:34.7466982Z   extensions are enabled. This is the default in a stable JupyterLab release if you
2026-06-19T01:01:34.7467620Z   have no extensions installed.
2026-06-19T01:01:34.7468372Z * Dev mode (`--dev-mode`): uses the unpublished local JavaScript packages in the
2026-06-19T01:01:34.7469159Z   `dev_mode` folder.  In this case JupyterLab will show a red stripe at the top of
2026-06-19T01:01:34.7469918Z   the page.  It can only be used if JupyterLab is installed as `pip install -e .`.
